#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:158
msgid "Ethernet pins"
msgstr "Ethernet pinovi"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:160
msgid ""
"The N6 exposes the Ethernet PHY's MDI pairs on dedicated pads next to the "
"GPIO header. The MDI pins are not safe to wire straight to an RJ45 — "
"Ethernet magnetics (an isolation transformer, either built into a magjack or"
" on the shield) are **required** between the PHY and the cable. The OpenMV "
"PoE shield includes them; if you're rolling your own jack, use a "
"magnetics‑integrated RJ45 or an external transformer."
msgstr ""
"N6 izlaže MDI parove Ethernet PHY‑a na namjenskim jastučićima pokraj GPIO "
"zaglavlja. MDI pinovi nije sigurno spajati izravno na RJ45 — Ethernet "
"magnetika (izolacijski transformator, bilo ugrađen u magjack ili na shieldu)"
" **obavezna** je između PHY‑a i kabela. OpenMV PoE shield uključuje je; ako "
"sami izrađujete priključak, koristite RJ45 s integriranom magnetikom ili "
"vanjski transformator."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:167
msgid ""
"**ETH_LED** — link/activity LED. Active low when a link is up; flashes on "
"traffic."
msgstr ""
"**ETH_LED** — LED veze/aktivnosti. Aktivan nisko kada je veza uspostavljena;"
" bljeska pri prometu."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:169
msgid "**DA P / DA N** — pair A (TX in 10/100, used by all speeds)."
msgstr ""
"**DA P / DA N** — par A (TX kod 10/100, koristi se pri svim brzinama)."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:170
msgid "**DB P / DB N** — pair B (RX in 10/100, used by all speeds)."
msgstr ""
"**DB P / DB N** — par B (RX kod 10/100, koristi se pri svim brzinama)."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:171
msgid "**DC P / DC N** — pair C, only used at gigabit."
msgstr "**DC P / DC N** — par C, koristi se samo pri gigabitu."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:172
msgid "**DD P / DD N** — pair D, only used at gigabit."
msgstr "**DD P / DD N** — par D, koristi se samo pri gigabitu."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:174
msgid ""
"10/100 Mb/s only needs pairs **A** and **B**. Gigabit needs all four pairs "
"**A–D**."
msgstr ""
"10/100 Mb/s treba samo parove **A** i **B**\\ . Gigabit treba sva četiri "
"para **A–D**\\ ."

