msgid ""
"**BOOT1** — switch that puts the board into developer mode for use with ST's"
" tooling (an ST‑LINK attached to the ARM 10‑pin SWD/JTAG header). Leave this"
" disabled for normal operation with OpenMV firmware and tools."
msgstr ""
"**BOOT1** — prekidač koji ploču stavlja u razvojni način za korištenje sa "
"ST‑ovim alatima (ST‑LINK priključen na ARM 10‑pinsko SWD/JTAG zaglavlje). "
"Ostavite ovo onemogućeno za normalan rad s OpenMV firmverom i alatima."

