"The ``fir`` driver only talks to the sensor over **I²C 2** — wire the module"
" to ``P4`` (SCL) and ``P5`` (SDA)."
msgstr ""
"``fir`` upravljački program komunicira sa senzorom samo preko **I²C 2** — "
"spojite modul na ``P4`` (SCL) i ``P5`` (SDA)."

